    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA BEAUTIFUL DETACHED FAMILY HOME IN A PICTURE PERFECT LOCATION\n\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market a magnificent five bedroom detached residence on a substantial private site located at School Road, Carnmore. \n\nLocated in an area of great natural beauty, this wonderful private home is finished to an exceptionally high standard, constructed in 2000 and comprising of circa 356.99 sq.m and set on premier mature site measuring circa 1.11 acres.\n\nPerfectly positioned just 350 metres Carnmore National School, 1.2 km from the local GAA grounds and 3km from Carnmore Cross. \n\nCarnmore has a strong residential community, the area offers an idyllic rural setting, whilst still providing a host of local amenities & services. \n\nThe property also has easy access to M6 & M18 motorways providing quick links to Oranmore, Athenry & Galway City.\n\nSchool Road Carnmore would be the perfect home boasting bright, spacious, and well-designed accommodation throughout with lush green surroundings. \n\nOn entering the property, you are greeted by a large entrance hall with feature stairs and tiled flooring, ample living space comprising of three lounge rooms two of which have feature fireplaces, an open plan kitchen and dining room with access to a rear patio and a ground floor bedroom or optional office. A bathroom and utility room completes the ground floor.\n\nOn the first floor a bright landing leads to a main bathroom with feature tiling and four large double bedrooms, two of which provide en suite bathrooms. \n\nA full stair allows access to the attic space which contains three attic rooms providing an abundance of storage space.\n\nA beautiful stone wall encompasses this magnificent site with wrought iron gates leading to the tarmacadam driveway with ample parking, rolling green lawns, mature planting, and a beautiful patio area for outdoor gatherings.\n\nA separate block built garage sits adjacent to the property blends seamlessly into the wonderful landscaping.\n\nSchool Road is undoubtedly one of the finest properties to come to the market in recent times and is everything you could want from a family home in terms of lifestyle, location, and natural amenity.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database For Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 OFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PMProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie NOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Magnificent five bed detached residence</li><li> Idyllic rural setting close to all amenities</li><li> Substantial private site measuring c. 1.11 acre</li><li> Well-designed accommodation throughout</li><li> Large attic space with abundance of storage</li><li> Mature gardens with rolling lawns & patio area</li><li> Separate large garage with plenty of storage</li><li> Minutes from Carnmore NS and GAA grounds</li><li> 3km from Carnmore Cross & 12km from Galway City</li><li> Quick access to Claregalway, Athenry & Oranmore</ul>"
      },
